WEBVTT

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.790
Nice. But why all of a sudden?

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:24.370
Good question.
For some reason, headquarters

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:30.500
is rewarding you for your efforts
with an overnight beach vacation.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.950
Maybe, while we're gone...

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.450
They'll take Chacha?

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:42.450
Nah. Chacha has been a boon to
the Saitama Branch, so no worries there.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.160
Oh.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.500
Chacha and Runba are guarding the fort,

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.700
so you should all take this opportunity
to let your hair down.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.700
The sea!

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:45.250
Super HXEROS!

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:49.290
Episode 9:
Hadakana Beach Season Opening!

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:55.250
Well, I'll be back
to pick you up tomorrow.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.330
Have fun until then.

00:02:57.330 --> 00:02:58.580
Thanks, Uncle.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.580
The sea!

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:12.040
I can't believe there's a beach like this
in the metro area!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:14.120
Hadakana Beach.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:18.250
I've never heard of it before,
but I guess it's a pretty popular tourist spot.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:18.750
"THE FIRST NUDE BEACH
IN THE COUNTRY NOW OPEN"

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:24.080
"THE FIRST NUDE BEACH
IN THE COUNTRY NOW OPEN"
And it says this is
the country's first nude beach.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.410
W-Wait. What?

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:30.750
But nobody else is here.

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:34.700
Good! It's like our own private beach.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:35.790
All right!

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:40.750
First one in the water gets an extra dish
all to themselves for dinner!

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.830
You're on!

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:45.700
Wait, Sora! Retto!

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:56.160
I'll lay a towel out.
You can go in the water, Hoshino.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.250
R-Really?

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:02.950
Thanks.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:11.370
Hey!

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:14.330
You don't leave me behind!

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:19.040
Hoshino isn't very honest
with her feelings, huh?

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:23.200
Oh, that's right.
I'd better put sunblock on.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.830
This feels great.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:41.160
This is my first time going to a beach.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.450
Boom!

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:48.540
Hey! What was that for?

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:55.450
When you come to the sea,
you have to at least taste the salt.

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.330
What's this on my hand?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.450
Wh-What is that?

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:10.250
I'm not sure. Maybe a sea cucumber?

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.910
I've never seen this kind before, though.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:16.250
How can you touch something so grotesque?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.830
It's not poisonous or harmful, so relax.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:22.040
R-Really?

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:35.370
How is this harmless?

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:38.660
Huh? Maybe it's an unusual type.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:41.660
H-Help!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.410
Wh-What are they?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.750
Are they the same as what squirted me?

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:08.540
What the heck were they?

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:11.750
We can't go back in the water
with them there!

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:16.080
It's a shame, coming here
without being able to enjoy the sea.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.790
Excuse me.

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:20.830
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.450
We'll wait here for you.

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:31.410
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:36.580
It's been so long since I've had guests
that prepping took me a while.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:42.950
Not at all. We expected to stay
at the beach longer, but came in early.

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:46.250
I apologize for arriving
ahead of schedule.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:50.330
You all went to the beach?

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:53.200
I'm sure you had a nasty surprise, then.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.790
Yes.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.830
What are those things?

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:01.410
I assume you saw
the pistol sea cucumbers.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.660
Pistol sea cucumbers?

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:07.620
That's just what we call them.

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:11.250
This new kind of sea cucumber suddenly
appeared over the summer in droves.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:14.000
I had them exterminated,
but they keep coming back.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:19.250
People have stopped coming to the beach,
which is killing my business.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:27.160
I hate to say this, but I don't recommend
going back in the water.

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:29.000
It must be tough.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.620
What the heck?
During our first real time off...

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.250
Hey!

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:40.250
The exterminators were supposed
to come today, but they're late.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:44.290
Hey, yo!
We're here to slay some sea cukes!

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.660
Good timing.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:57.750
Hey, what are you guys doing here?

00:07:57.750 --> 00:07:59.660
That's our line!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:01.830
Both of you, calm down!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:04.250
I don't get it.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:08.200
Oh, you're the cutest exterminators
I've ever seen.

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:15.540
You guys may be here on vacation,
but we've got a job to do.

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:22.450
Which way is the lobby again?

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:32.500
Excuse me.
D-Do you know where the boys' bathroom is?

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:35.540
Yeah. It's just down the hall.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:37.160
Thank you!

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:42.870
Huh. I thought maybe we were the only ones
here, but she's about our age.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:48.950
U-Um, are you Retto Enjo?

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:50.250
Yeah.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:54.660
I'm a fan!
Please shake my hand!

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:57.540
I should've asked before doing it, huh?

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:01.000
No, I don't mind,
but don't you have to use the restroom?

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.700
Oh, that's right!

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.580
Excuse me!

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.370
What was that about?

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.620
I see.

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:14.620
Sheesh. Why do we have to work
when you guys get to play?

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:18.000
I don't know,
but it is a weird coincidence.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:22.200
Unless this is also part of the plan.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.540
It's possible.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:27.000
So Retto Enjo didn't come with you?

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:30.330
Now that you mention it,
one of our members is missing, too.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:33.000
Oh, there you are!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.750
O-Oh, you two were together?

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.750
Yoo-hoo, Enjo.

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:41.500
Huh? You two? What are you doing here?

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:46.040
What? You didn't explain it to him?

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:47.250
Sorry.

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:50.290
I've heard about you, Retto Enjo.

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:52.370
I'm Yona Ichogi.

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:55.330
I'm more or less
the coordinator of Tokyo Branch.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:58.620
And this girly boy is Toma Taiga.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.620
Nice to meet you.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:03.790
I heard these two caused you trouble
when they went off on their own,

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:04.950
so I apologize for that.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.870
Oh, it's okay.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.750
Well, since we're all here,

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.620
let's go, Saitama Branch members.

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.790
What do you think, Moena?

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:24.040
It's hard to tell
with the smell of the seawater,

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.830
but I don't think there are
any Kiseichuu nearby.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.450
According to the locals,

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:35.080
several people sighted Kiseichuu-like creatures
while exterminating the sea cucumbers.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:39.660
All we can do then is wipe
these suckers out 'til the Kiseichuu show.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.660
Kiseichuu? What's going on here?

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:50.750
Um, going by Tokyo Branch's investigation,
Kiseichuu are hiding out on this beach

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:53.830
and using those sea cucumbers
to drive people away.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:56.950
As always,
they go with a complicated plan.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:01.200
After listening to the innkeeper,
we can't just do nothing,

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.120
so we'll help, too.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:04.500
I see.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:08.000
So, how do you kill these things?

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.660
Gross!

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.450
What are you doing?

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:21.160
What? We're exterminating.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:24.040
The annoying thing about these
pistol sea cucumbers is how they squirt,

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:29.250
but if they lose a certain amount of
fluid, they become flaccid and can't move.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:32.450
The plan is to do this until the Kiseichuu
become so mad that they show up,

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:35.200
and then we exterminate them.

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:37.370
So help us out with them.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:39.950
I didn't know helping
would require doing that!

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:43.120
I have to help, too?

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:44.620
Sorry.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.790
I'll be gentle.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:50.580
I'm just gonna bite the bullet.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:53.500
Wh-What do you think?

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:56.870
In my opinion, only the person you love
should be able to do that to you.

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:00.450
Jeez. Are you sure you're with HXEROS?

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:05.080
Half-assed members will be punished!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:10.950
W-We'll do it over there.

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.500
Yeah.

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:16.200
Nama.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:21.910
Never mind the namaste.
I'm Namachuu.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.120
I'm glad you're here, Toma.

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:28.750
This gender ratio is crazy, isn't it?

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:33.200
It's because women are known
to feel pleasure more intensely than men.

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:36.620
I hope we'll be okay
this far apart from them.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:40.580
What if a Kiseichuu appeared here?

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:42.200
Well, we'd be fine.

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.330
It was unintentional,

00:12:43.330 --> 00:12:47.540
but I've got enough H-energy saved up
to take on at least one Kiseichuu.

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.870
That's amazing.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:54.250
Um, after hearing that,
I've got a favor to ask.

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.790
Please become my coach!

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:05.040
It might be my fault that Murasame
and Wakakusa often go off on their own.

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:08.040
My H-energy is a little different.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:12.160
I just can't seem to collect any,
so I keep failing on our missions.

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:15.950
I'm always causing trouble
for those three.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:23.160
But then I heard of an incredible HERO in
Saitama who can feel H-energy with anything.

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:26.000
You've been my idol since then, Enjo.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:28.700
Is that a compliment?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:32.620
So I was hoping you'd share
some kind of trick to feeling H-energy!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:38.330
A trick?
It's not like I try to collect H-energy.

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:42.250
I-I see. Sorry to get weird on you.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:48.620
Well, as a boy, I can understand your feelings
of wanting to protect your teammates.

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:53.000
Yeah. And since we're both members
of HXEROS, I want to help you.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.250
Really?

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:58.950
So before that, friend to friend,
I need you to tell me about your H-energy.

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:02.000
But that's embarrassing.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:07.040
Oh, come on. We're both men,
so how bad can it be?

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:10.500
A-Actually...

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.000
That's...

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:15.750
By the girls!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.410
Th-This is...

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.660
A Kiseichuu?

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:32.410
This is what you get, humans...
for molesting my adorable pets.

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:37.620
With human H-energy, the more sensitive
the spot, the easier it is to collect.

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:41.250
I wonder how long it will take
before they've dried up completely.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:49.040
I'm going to wring them out of H-energy,
just like I did with the other guests.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.620
Damn it. I have no strength.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.450
Kirara, knowing you,

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:57.910
just having some H-energy siphoned
shouldn't be a big deal.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.580
Easy for you to say.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:03.540
With these slimy things
all over me, I can't feel any H-energy!

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:06.330
Toma, come here a second.

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:11.410
For starters,
I'll attack the Kiseichuu herself

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:14.290
while you tear those sea cucumbers
off of everyone.

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.120
Okay. Got it.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:20.040
Huh? That's strange.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:23.540
After seeing a sight like that,
I'm not picking up any H-energy.

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:26.080
Coach, on your back!

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:31.540
It seems there were more humans hiding.

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:33.410
Get off, you!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.750
A-Are you okay?

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:37.250
I'll live. But...

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:40.370
...they made off with most of my H-energy.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:43.830
I don't think I'll be able
to knock her out with one punch now.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.450
So, Toma...

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:48.250
...you have to save everyone!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.250
I can't do that!

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:53.910
That, or should the two of us
help each other collect H-energy?

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:55.330
Now, that would be impossible, right?

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.450
R-Right, but...

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.080
Also, we didn't get to finish
our conversation from before.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:04.700
Whatever form your H-energy takes,
I want to help you.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:08.410
We're on different teams,
but we're still colleagues, aren't we?

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:10.870
Coach.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:15.620
He's right. I can't hide it forever.

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:23.790
Coming out on your own?
You're good sports, humans.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:27.330
Hey, Toma, I can really leave this to you?

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:32.330
Coach, you told me that I'm the only one
who can collect H-energy!

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:35.620
Yeah, but you didn't tell me
how you're gonna do it.

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:36.790
Sorry.

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:38.540
Sorry!

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:43.200
That's right.

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:45.040
My H-energy...

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:50.870
...it's an onlooker's appreciation
of H-energy!

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:54.540
Hey, watch where you're touching me!

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:58.950
Toma pushed me!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:01.830
Coach really knows how to land.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:05.410
Right in the middle of their bodies.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:10.500
Seeing it right before me is much
more stimulating than I even imagined!

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:14.620
Something is filling me up from within.

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:16.620
I'm gonna burst!

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:20.700
Don't tell me you people are...

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.200
...those...

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:26.410
HX... EROS.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:42.040
"WOMEN'S BATH"

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:46.410
I never thought I'd see the day
when Toma would beat a Kiseichuu.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:51.540
Saitama Branch members,
thank you so much for today.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:55.000
I'd like to do something for you
to show our gratitude.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.540
You're such a good person, Yona.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:02.080
I've got it! Why don't you come
and visit us tomorrow in Tokyo?

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:04.700
If you'd like, we could show you around.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:08.410
What are you planning
without a show of hands, Yona?

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:13.040
Sorry.
Murasame might not want to participate.

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:16.370
If Retto Enjo comes...

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:18.870
Of course I'll go!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:21.250
Th-That's unusual.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:28.250
Hey, look. The sunset.

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:35.830
A lot happened today...

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:38.660
...but when I think that we
protected this sight,

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:40.910
it all seems worth it.

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:45.160
Are you okay, Coach?

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:48.080
You don't have any scratches?

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.660
I'll be fine.

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:52.580
But thank you for today...

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:55.750
...for doing that favor for me.

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:58.200
Don't worry about it.

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.410
You know, I'm envious.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:03.500
This body... do you train?

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:05.830
Well, a little weight training.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:14.290
Maybe you should put a little more meat
on those bones, Toma.

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:18.290
Hey, Toma, you're not holding out on me
with anything else, are you?

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.580
N-No, but...

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:23.620
Okay, if you say so.

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.000
Sorry.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:33.450
I'm embarrassed
about my oversized nipples.

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:36.540
I-It's no big deal.

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:46.120
I thought something felt weird
on my inner thigh.

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:49.450
I guess one of those sea cucumbers
was still attached.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.330
How could you not have noticed?

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.290
Whoa!

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:15.040
Give me a break. That's too much exposure.

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:18.080
I'll never be able to keep my eyes
off of that, so I'll cover him.

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:24.950
It's morning! Are you boys awake?!

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:28.910
They can hear you without shouting.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:34.080
Retto, are you that sexually frustrated?

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.750
I apologize for not noticing!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:40.080
The hell? I would have given a hand
if you just said something.

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:43.620
It's not what it looks like!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.910
See?

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.330
Help, Toma!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.120
Good morning, Coach.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:57.500
"DINING ROOM"

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:59.290
"DINING ROOM"
Thank you.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:04.120
My husband was euphoric when he saw
that the beach was sea cucumber-free.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:07.080
This will save our business.

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:12.750
To show our gratitude,
please enjoy breakfast on us.

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:22.750
So they're gonna
take us sightseeing in Tokyo?

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:26.000
I wonder where they'll take us.

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:28.120
Well, let's see.

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:31.330
I thought I would get your opinions
before deciding.

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:34.950
I'd like to go somewhere soothing.

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:38.500
I wanna check out the latest HERO merch.

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:44.120
I'd be delighted if we could go
to a gourmet place, but that's just me.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:47.410
Does Tokyo actually have all those spots?

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:48.830
Then...

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:53.450
I see. That might be perfect.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:57.950
I see. With the girls of Tokyo Branch...

00:21:57.950 --> 00:21:59.910
"EARTH DEFENSE FORCE
SAITAMA BRANCH"
I see. With the girls of Tokyo Branch...

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:04.910
I was just about to leave to pick you up.

00:22:04.910 --> 00:22:09.620
Yeah. That's fine. Just be careful.

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:14.870
Then maybe I'll take a little nap.

00:23:47.750 --> 00:23:49.580
Super HXEROS!

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:51.620
